{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00009","headline":"帝京篇十首 十 · 太宗皇帝","name":"帝京篇十首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"以兹游观极，悠然独长想。\n披卷览前踪，抚躬寻既往。\n望古茅茨约，瞻今兰殿广。\n人道恶高危，虚心戒盈荡。\n奉天竭诚敬，临民思惠养。\n纳善察忠谏，明科慎刑赏。\n六五诚难继，四三非易仰。\n广待淳化敷，方嗣云亭响。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}